I think I remember such an error from the last time I compiled
NetHack-De on Windows. But IIRC it was a problem trying to compile a
MingW binary under Cygwin.

I think adding '-mno-cygwin -isystem /usr/include/mingw' to CFLAGS and
'-mno-cygwin  -L/usr/lib/mingw' to LFLAGS helped.

